  - Clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3f18e8f54f2854649efe263a0da560e4, type: 3}
    Subtitles:
    - Start: 0.105
      End: 4.226
      Chinese: "远距连接组请留存本轮测试记录。"
      English: "Long-range connection staff should retain the latest test records."
    - Start: 4.9663
      End: 12.4682
      Chinese: "顶部防护板新增了几处碰痕，回收的样机头身连接正常。"
      English: "Fresh impact marks have been found on the overhead guard, although the recovered unit's head-to-body joints are intact."
    - Start: 13.2084
      End: 17.4695
      Chinese: "同批样机此前均已通过常规检查。"
      English: "All units in this batch had previously passed their routine checks."
    - Start: 18.2497
      End: 21.4905
      Chinese: "检修前，请保持工位原样。"
      English: "Leave the station as it is until maintenance arrives."
